{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7670919111279708425","title":"整车音响系统工程师-汽车","description":"1. 负责整车扬声器系统方案设计，交付符合整车产品定义，具有强大竞争力的音频产品；\n2. 负责车内.外扬声器的产品选型.性能指标定义.验收标准制定；\n3. 负责扬声器零部件开发计划的制定，跟踪，问题解决等项目管理相关工作；\n4. 牵头扬声器系统的问题排查解决；\n5. 牵头汽车声音技术的研究；","requirement":"1. 本科及以上学历，声学.电声.信号处理.电子工程.通信工程.自动化等专业；\n2. 3年以上汽车扬声器开发经验，完整经历过一个项目的开发和落地；\n3. 熟悉扬声器元器件设计.材料选型.制作工艺.仿真设计与验证.评价与测试方法；\n4. 熟悉整车造车过程，2年以上零部件开发及供应商管理经验；\n5. 熟悉调音验收及评价方法，有音频鉴赏能力。有基础的调音（音质和声场）能力，包含EQ，Gain，Delay等模块的使用者优先；\n6. 持有C2以上驾照；","city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1786025287348,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7659311908839262514","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘计划","i18n":"2027届校园招聘计划"},"limit_count":2,"active_status":1},"job_function":{"id":"7615833493755676955","name":"整车与系统工程类","en_name":"Vehicle and Systems Engineering","i18n_name":"整车与系统工程类"},"job_id":"7670919111279544585","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_